  "scope": [
    "Additive RawPixels/RAW_PIXELS and --kind raw-pixels reuse ProjectBatchRequest/kernel, snapshots, owned output bundles, SQLite checkpoint seals, reports and Stop/Continue; old Raw/RGB enum meanings stay unchanged",
    "Typed model, exact optional axes, bounded native stream policy and independent file metadata budget are shared by C++/nanobind/Python/native CLI",
    "Actual TIFF numeric blocks/votes/support match direct prediction across different source dimensions with unit spacing and explicit fractional axes",
    "Completed-image reuse hashes current raw inputs without inference and verifies every saved QWS1 file and QWL1 descriptor; mixed raw/RGB catalogs select tags correctly",
    "Changed source data, incompatible reader/model/lattice, missing/tampered output or checkpoint, quotas and no-resume preservation have distinguishing controls",
    "Native interruption retains completed images, resumes them and processes the suffix; unknown files survive owned cleanup; CLI/project relocation and immutable asynchronous project snapshots pass",
    "An actual OpenCV-trained model is predicted and reused by the training-OFF native executable; all 27 blocks match the installed ON consumer",
    "Generated nullable options/runtime surfaces and positive/negative typing match the installed wheel; all 195 SDK files and imported wheel members authenticate"
  ],
  "development": [
    "First native fixture reused a Document in two slots and correctly refused; fixed to independent Documents without changing ownership rules",
    "First relocation fixture compared normal and Windows extended path spelling; fixed to compare actual file identity before mapping the relative bundle",
    "Original development has 64 Python passes/one relocation failure/one skip and three passing native regressions/one ownership fixture failure; corrected source ec46efe has 67 Python passes/one skip and a passing affected native batch suite",
    "First stub-generation launch used a parent-only sys.path injection that its child did not inherit and produced no new declarations; final development interpreter package origin and installed-wheel stub check establish the actual runtime"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Installed Windows CPython 3.12 training/TIFF/project ON, GUI/GEOS/OpenSlide OFF only; separate backend-OFF checks are native, not an OFF wheel/platform qualification",
    "Fresh wheel package reuses workspace test dependencies through .pth; no clean-machine or release claim",
    "Batch targets are area objects; each raw output traverses its declared global lattice and masks its target ROI. Sparse ROI prediction traversal and process-memory/performance qualification are not claimed",
    "Restart/reuse is at completed-image checkpoints; interrupted current-image work is owned temporary output. Per-file prefix resume remains the separate CLI/native job workflow",
    "The first failing native fixture executable was not separately retained before cache reuse; its original log/XML/source manifest are retained along with original module/CLI products",
    "Desktop/managed viewer, bounded contour frontend apply, broader installed profiles, T5, streamed stitching and scientific/resource/hardware/release gates remain open"
  ],
